Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Web Content Administration|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Web Content Administration|
		|webContentSearchPageName|Web Content Search Page|
		|webContentSearchPortletName|Web Content Search|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Web Content Search Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Web Content Search Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Content Search|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Search Web Content
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Categories,Web Content Search|
	When Page add
		|pageName|Web Content Display Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Web Content Display Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And WebContent add PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContent view PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Web Content Search Page|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet search
		|webContentSearchTerm|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet view Results Entry
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet search
		|webContentSearchTerm|WC WebContent Content|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet view Results Entry
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet search
		|webContentSearchTerm|WC|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet view Results Entry
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet search
		|webContentSearchTerm|WebContent|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet view Results Entry
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet search
		|webContentSearchTerm|Title|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet view Results Entry
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet search
		|webContentSearchTerm|Content|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet view Results Entry
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet search
		|webContentSearchTerm|WC1|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet view No Results
		|webContentSearchTerm|WC1|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet search
		|webContentSearchTerm|WebContent1|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet view No Results
		|webContentSearchTerm|WebContent1|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet search
		|webContentSearchTerm|Title1|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet view No Results
		|webContentSearchTerm|Title1|
	And WebContentSearchPortlet search
